  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "Hey everyone~\n\nI've been working on a physics playground level, and this is one of the more frustrating bugs I've encountered alongside the other spawner related bug I posted here. \n\nFor whatever reason, even though the prefab I'm spawning is set to have gravity unchecked, occasionally on an upload I will notice that the spawner will spawn that prefab with gravity. \n\nThis results in me having to delete the spawner entirely, recreate it, and then upload it in order for the spawner to spawn the prefab with no gravity as it should. \n\nThanks in advance for looking into it!\n\n- With Love, TheArchitect",
